[10.037002, "o", "\u001b[3;37H\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[34m┌───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\u001b[4;37H│ \u001b[36mAUDIENCE — is this repo's traffic people or fetchers?\u001b[34m\u001b[21X\u001b[4;113H│\u001b[5;37H│\u001b[75X\u001b[5;113H│\u001b[6;37H│ \u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[33m  ratio     = uniq_cloners / max(uniq_visitors, 1)      [primary]\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[34m         │\u001b[7;37H│ \u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[33m  burst     = max_day_clones / window_clones\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[34m\u001b[30X\u001b[7;113H│\u001b[8;37H│ \u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[33m  depth     = views / uniq_visitors\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[34m\u001b[39X\u001b[8;113H│\u001b[9;37H│ \u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[33m  referrers = distinct referrers observed in the window\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[34m\u001b[19X\u001b[9;113H│\u001b[10;37H│\u001b[75X\u001b[10;113H│\u001b[11;37H│ \u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[33m  ratio <= 0.5 scores 1.0 (audience), >= 20.0 scores 0.0\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[34m\u001b[18X\u001b[11;113H│\u001b[12;37H│ \u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m  (crawler); log-scaled between. burst scores 1-burst: crawlers land\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[34m      │\u001b[13;37H│ \u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m  on push day, people spread out. depth peaks inside 1.5-8.0\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[34m\u001b[14X\u001b[13;113H│\u001b[14;37H│ \u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m  views/visitor and falls away on BOTH sides — 150 views from 2 unique\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[34m    │\u001b[15;37H│ \u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m  visitors is one client hammering, not deep reading. referrers score\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[34m     │\u001b[16;37H│ \u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m  distinct/5.\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[34m\u001b[61X\u001b[16;113H│\u001b[17;37H│\u001b[75X\u001b[17;113H│\u001b[18;37H│ \u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[33m  score = weighted mean over available components\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[34m\u001b[25X\u001b[18;113H│\u001b[19;37H│ \u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m  weights: ratio 0.45, burst 0.2, depth 0.2, referrers 0.15\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[34m\u001b[15X\u001b[19;113H│\u001b[20;37H│ \u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[33m  label:  >= 0.6 audience, >= 0.3 mixed, else crawler\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[34m\u001b[21X\u001b[20;113H│\u001b[21;37H│\u001b[75X\u001b[21;113H│\u001b[22;37H│ \u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m  low-signal when uniq_cloners + uniq_visitors < 10. Read it\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[34m\u001b[14X\u001b[22;113H│\u001b[23;37H│ \u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m  as 'not enough evidence', not as a middling result: five unique\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[34m         │\u001b[24;37H│ \u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m  cloners and two unique visitors is four data points, and calling\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[34m        │\u001b[25;37H│ \u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m  that 'mixed' reports a finding where there is only an absence of\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[34m        │\u001b[26;37H│ \u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m  one. MIXED means the components genuinely disagree — some human\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[34m         │\u001b[27;37H│ \u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m  signal, some fetcher signal, on a repo with enough traffic to say.\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[34m      │\u001b[28;37H│\u001b[75X\u001b[28;113H│\u001b[29;37H│ \u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m  burst is withheld below 7 days in the window, depth below\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[34m\u001b[15X\u001b[29;113H│\u001b[30;37H│ \u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m  3 unique visitors, referrers when the store has no referrer\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[34m             │\u001b[31;37H│ \u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m  history. Withheld components are dropped and the weights renormalized —\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[34m │\u001b[32;37H│ \u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m  never scored zero. Missing components are listed per row.\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[34m\u001b[15X\u001b[32;113H│\u001b[33;37H│\u001b[75X\u001b[33;113H│\u001b[34;37H│ \u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m  inputs: durable daily store, UNIQUES (field 1) except depth's\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[34m           │\u001b[35;37H│\u001b[75X\u001b[35;113H│\u001b[36;37H└─\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[0;2m [?] or [esc] closes \u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[34m─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\u001b[38;2H\u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[30m\u001b[46m[?]/[esc] close derivation\u001b[39;49m\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[36;60H"]
